---
import Demo from '../layouts/Demo.astro';
import meta from '../demos/send-guard/meta';
import Island from '../demos/send-guard/Demo.tsx';
---
<Demo meta={meta}>
  <Island client:only="react" />
  <div slot="notes">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>After a typing pause, the model checks the draft and relevant text fragments. Channel context and local policy combine the results into an allow, warning or block decision.</p>
    <h3>Demo scope</h3>
    <p>This is a simulated chat composer. Audience-fit scores are advisory and can miss a mismatch. The guard can make mistakes; a green verdict does not guarantee that a message is safe to share.</p>
  </div>
</Demo>
